URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/event/1656666228/profile
SUMMARY:9th Grade and New Family Social
DESCRIPTION:Parents and students are invited to join us for tours of the building\, to  \nmeet and greet classmates\, and enjoy water ice and soft pretzels as we  \nwelcome the class of 2022 and families new to our school district!  - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/1656666228/profile
END:VEVENT
