UID:calendar-event-1988607703@schoology.com
URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/event/1988607703/profile
SUMMARY:EEPE Verification Form Senior Due Date
DESCRIPTION:*Spring Semester EEPE Reminder*\n\nSpring Semester EEPE Verification Forms for the 2nd Semester will be due on  \nWednesday\, April 24th for seniors and Friday\, May 17th for Juniors and  \nSophomores.   Verification Forms can be found attached to this announcement  \nand on Schoology.  All Spring Semester Application Forms must be submitted  \nthrough the EEPE Schoology course as “Verification Form”.  Any student  \nwho does not submit the Verification Form by the due date\, will be dropped  \nfrom the course and not receive credit for the course. \n\n \n\nVerification Forms for the Spring 2019 Semester of EEPE will be due on April  \n24th for Seniors and May 17th for Sophomore and Juniors.\n\n \n\n*Students participating in a Club Sport MUST complete a Verification Form if  \nEEPE is on the student’s semester II schedule.*\n\n \n\n \n\n“Verification Form” Assignment is now open to everyone. You may submit  \nyour Application Form at this time. - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/1988607703/profile
END:VEVENT
