UID:calendar-event-2208409442@schoology.com
URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/event/2208409442/profile
SUMMARY:Picture Day
DESCRIPTION:*Picture Day – Friday\, August 30th*\n\nPicture Day for all 9th\, 10th\, 11th and new 12th graders will be held on  \n*Friday\, August 30th*. Students will receive a photo slip and attend the  \npicture day during their English class on Friday. All students (9th\,  \n10th\,11th and new 12th graders) must attend this event and have their  \npictures taken. These pictures will be used for their ID cards and their  \nyearbook photo. If you are absent on Friday\, a makeup date of Friday\,  \nSeptember 6th is available. It is your responsible to attend this event and  \nensure that your picture has been taken.\n\nInformation regarding purchasing pictures has been sent your home and is  \navailable in the Main Office.\n\nThank you! - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/2208409442/profile
END:VEVENT
