DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20210611
UID:calendar-event-5019173660@schoology.com
URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/event/5019173660/profile
SUMMARY:Textbook / Laptop Collection
DESCRIPTION:*Textbook / Laptop Collection – Grades 9\, 10 and 11*\n\n/In-Person Students/\n\nIn-Person students will have the opportunity to return their textbooks during  \ntheir assigned classes on June 10th and 11th. Individual teachers will be  \ncollecting these items during the school day. Student assigned laptops will  \nbe collected during your child’s English class on either June 10th or June  \n11th depending on which day students are scheduled for English.\n\n \n\n/Virtual Students/\n\nVirtual students will have the opportunity to return their textbooks and  \nlaptop on June 10th between 3:00 PM and 5:00 PM in the small gym. Students  \nand parents are reminded that they must complete the PowerSchool Health  \nScreening prior to their arrival at CHS on June 10th. Students will be  \nrequired to provide the green PowerSchool Health Screening pass when they  \narrive and enter the small gym.\n\n \n\n/Last Call Drop Off/\n\nA final collection date on June 14th will be available for any student who  \nwas not able to drop off their laptop or textbooks on June 10th or June  \n11th. Students will be able to return these items from 12:00 PM to 3:00 PM  \nin the Main Lobby. All previous mentioned health screening processes will be  \nin effect on June 14th. \n\n \n\n  - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/5019173660/profile
END:VEVENT
