SUMMARY:Jr. Model UN - TEM Talk - Dr. Bibi - South Asia Part 1 - Virtual
DESCRIPTION:Here is the link for the Jr. Model UN meeting on Monday\, Nov. 20th\, at 7:00  \np.m.\n\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\n\nJoin on your computer\, mobile app or room device\n\nClick here to join the meeting [1]\n\nMeeting ID: 243 225 857 093 \n\n \n\nPasscode: pRmdxU \n\nDownload Teams [2] | Join on the web [3]\n\n*Or call in (audio only)*\n\n+1 717-431-7267\,\,873331820# [4]   United States\, Lancaster\n\nPhone Conference ID: 873 331 820# \n\nFind a local number [5] | Reset PIN [6]\n\nLearn More [7] | Meeting options [8]\n\n\n[1] https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3Ameeting_NGQwMzQ5NmUtZjJjZC00YjRlLTk0ZTUtYWQ0MjVmOGQ4YTk0%40thread.v2/0?context=%7B%22Tid%22%3A%22d7991aab-bfe0-46e8-8315-ded87d122e63%22%2C%22Oid%22%3A%22fc0e36fd-5574-429d-9d1a-f880f8b36085%22%7D\n[2] https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-teams/download-app\n[3] https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-teams/join-a-meeting\n[4] +17174317267873331820#\n[5] https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/c1258c60-b2eb-4390-82d0-9f726500c579?id=873331820\n[6] https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/usp/pstnconferencing\n[7] https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting\n[8] https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId=fc0e36fd-5574-429d-9d1a-f880f8b36085&amp\;tenantId=d7991aab-bfe0-46e8-8315-ded87d122e63&amp\;threadId=19_meeting_NGQwMzQ5NmUtZjJjZC00YjRlLTk0ZTUtYWQ0MjVmOGQ4YTk0@thread.v2&amp\;messageId=0&amp\;language=en-US - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/6986014076/profile
