UID:calendar-event-6964153243@schoology.com
URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/event/6964153243/profile
SUMMARY:Reading Olympics Competition
DESCRIPTION:TCHS Brandywine (443 Boot Rd.\, Downingtown)   * Remember all students need  \nto arrange their own transportation to and from the event.\n\n*When: Tuesday\, April 9\, 2024*\n\n \n\n*Where: TCHS – Brandywine**\, *443 Boot Rd\, Downingtown\, PA 19335\n\n \n\n*[Please enter through Entrance D\, the main entrance\, for the event.*]\n\n \n\n*Event Time: 6:00 PM – 8:10 PM*\n\n \n\nStudents and Chaperones please arrive at *5:45pm*\n\n \n\nRound 1: 6:00 PM – 6:40pm\n\n \n\nRound 2: 6:45 PM – 7:25pm\n\n \n\nRound 3: 7:30 PM – 8:10pm\n\n \n\n*Ribbons will be awarded immediately after Round 3 in your Round 3 rooms\n\n \n\n**See the attachment for your room locations! - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/6964153243/profile
END:VEVENT
