UID:calendar-event-8246102592@schoology.com
URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/event/8246102592/profile
SUMMARY:DECA Rise Against Hunger Meal-Packaging Event (Cafeteria)
DESCRIPTION:Register here: http://events.riseagainsthunger.org/ConestogaDECA2026 [1]\n[2]\n\nJoin us on *March 6th in the cafeteria* for our meal-packaging event\, where  \nDECA members will help pack 10\,000 meals for families in need worldwide! \n\n * Free to attend \n * Counts for Key Club or NHS hours (no double-dipping) \n * Topgolf coupon for every volunteer ($15-$25) \n * Work with friends in a high-energy event with music! \n\nImportant: \n\n * Please register only if you are sure you can attend — spots are\n   limited! \n * You may sign up for one or multiple shifts \n * The registration and donation page are the same link \n\n\n[1] http://events.riseagainsthunger.org/ConestogaDECA2026\n[2] https://riseagainsthunger.org/register/?id=701Pj00000kT2YcIAK - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/8246102592/profile
END:VEVENT
