SUMMARY:DECA - Registration and $110 DUE
DESCRIPTION:Please bring your dues payment (*$110* cash or check made payable to  \nConestoga High School) to the *Main Office by Monday 10/5* where Ms. Close  \nwill direct students to the drop off box and/or collect the envelope herself.  \nBelow is the payment breakdown:\n$25 DECA Membership fee\n$15 Conestoga DECA T-shirt\n$40 District Competition fee (includes lunch)\n$30 Bus to District Competition All prepared/written events individuals will  \nstill pay the FULL FEE. But when you pay for your State competition fee\,  \nwhatever part of the fee that goes to districts is subtracted from your state  \nfee. ($70 off your State fee) If you have any questions\, please reach out to  \nany officer\, Mr. Jones\, or Ms. Harris. I look forward to having all of you as  \npart of the largest DECA chapter in Pennsylvania! Mr. Jones - DECA Advisor  \nMs. Harris - DECA Advisor - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/8584153805/profile
