SUMMARY:Chapter 12 Reading
DESCRIPTION:QUESTIONS \n\n \n\n 1) What changes to Chinese administration and bureaucracy did Song rulers\n    introduce? \n\n \n\n 1) What was the impact of new agricultural techniques in Song China? \n\n \n\n 1) How did advances in metallurgy techniques contribute to the commercial\n    revolution in Song China? \n\n \n\n 1) How did the practice of footbinding reinforce gender inequalities in\n    China? \n\n \n\n 1) How did the commercial revolution influence the development of social\n    structures in China? \n\n \n\n 1) What were the effects of technological diffusion among China\, Vietnam\,\n    Korea\, and Japan? \n\n \n\n 1) To what degree did Japan\, Korea\, and Vietnam synthesized Chinese\n    culture?  \n\n \n\n \n\n  - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/assignment/8574186645
END:VEVENT
